dtk-update (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * refactor: centralize Linyaps backend wiring in BackendFactory::attachLinyaps,
    eliminating duplicated probe/connect boilerplate in GUI and both trays.
  * refactor: route DependencyResolver dry-run parsing by real backendId (APT/DNF
    formats) and degrade gracefully to target-only packages for backends without
    structured transaction output (fixes false failures on dnf/linyaps).
  * docs: align README (en/zh-CN) packaging script reference, design constraints and
    backend-extension guide with the actual implementation; clarify attachLinyaps wiring.
  * debian: add dtk-update.install, expand control Description, refresh changelog.
  * ci: fix arm64 runner label typo (ubuntu-24.04-arm64 -> ubuntu-24.04-arm) and add a
    120-minute timeout guard for the loong64 qemu build job.
  * refactor: decouple multi-backend wiring, modularize upgrade flow,
    synchronize docs, translations, CI and debian packaging.
  * Initial release: tray plugin skeleton, package backend abstraction,
    dependency resolver, residue cleaner, security advisor, monitor,
    systemd user service and debian packaging.

 -- dtk-update taotieren <admin@taotieren.com>  Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
